[PrintTextModified Text:因大魔女的诅咒而变成魔女的人类，<br>会产生强烈的杀人冲动，<br>最终变成丧失理智的怪物。|#0105Adv06_Margo010| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们是这种诅咒的受害者。<br>而你作为真正的魔女则不同，是这样吗？|#0105Adv06_Margo011| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:是、是的。就是这样……|#0105Adv06_Meruru013| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且我是大魔女大人的宠儿，<br>所以还被赐予了【魔女杀手】这种特殊的魔法，用来封印魔女。|#0105Adv06_Meruru014| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:【魔女杀手】……？和特雷德基姆类似的东西？|#0105Adv06_Margo012| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:是的……不过，比那种药更强大，<br>是所有魔女都畏惧的魔法。|#0105Adv06_Meruru015| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所、所以其实，<br>只要各位变成魔女了，我就可以轻易杀死你们……|#0105Adv06_Meruru016| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:当、当然我不会那么做的……！|#0105Adv06_Meruru017| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

