; ＠備考◆悲痛な叫び

[PrintTextModified Text:——为什么！！|#0105Adv06_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛不由自主地发出了撕心裂肺的尖叫。|#0105Adv06_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么你能若无其事地说出这些！？<br>梅露露，你一直在欺骗我们，对吧！？|#0105Adv06_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你说我们是朋友，对我们那么体贴，<br>总是那么关心我们，<br>这些全都是假的吗！？|#0105Adv06_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground-Middle,Ema-Middle Loop:false
@HideActors ActorIds:Ema-Middle Lazy:false
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:MaskingRectangle SubId:Middle LogWarning:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:不、不是假的……！|#0105Adv06_Meruru018| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为大魔女大人是必须找到的。<br>只要能找到大魔女大人，<br>对大家来说也一定会是、是救赎……|#0105Adv06_Meruru019| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所以我，虽然很痛苦，<br>但还是很努力、非常努力地做了很多很多事……|#0105Adv06_Meruru020| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:指示看守提供难吃的食物，<br>在娱乐室放很多恐怖电影……|#0105Adv06_Meruru021| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了让大家感到不快，<br>我竭尽了全力……|#0105Adv06_Meruru022| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了了解大家讨厌什么，就必须和大家共同生活，<br>所以我才和大家一起当囚犯，<br>只为了和大家亲近起来……|#0105Adv06_Meruru023| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

